 "28"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/JLubu0orxPw/0.webp", "preference": -8, "id": "29"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JLubu0orxPw/hqdefault.jpg", "height": 360, "width": 480, "preference": -7, "id": "30", "resolution": "480x360"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/JLubu0orxPw/hqdefault.webp", "preference": -6, "id": "31"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JLubu0orxPw/sddefault.jpg", "height": 480, "width": 640, "preference": -5, "id": "32", "resolution": "640x480"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/JLubu0orxPw/sddefault.webp", "preference": -4, "id": "33"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JLubu0orxPw/hq720.jpg", "preference": -3, "id": "34"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/JLubu0orxPw/hq720.webp", "preference": -2, "id": "35"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JLubu0orxPw/maxresdefault.jpg", "preference": -1, "id": "36"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/JLubu0orxPw/maxresdefault.webp", "preference": 0, "id": "37"}], "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JLubu0orxPw/sddefault.jpg", "description": "Humanity has \u201clost the fight against climate change\u201d.\nWant to restore the planet\u2019s ecosystems and see your impact in monthly videos? The first 100 people to join Planet Wild with my code ASTRUM2 will get the first month for free on me: https://planetwild.com/r/astrumearth/join/2 \nIf you want to get to know them better first, check out their mission restoring a forest without planting trees: https://planetwild.com/r/astrumearth/m33/2 \n\n\u2580\u2580\u2580\u2580\u2580\u2580\n\nThis will be the most important video you will ever watch. Join us as we dive into the hard facts about climate change. Is it really game over?\n\n\u2580\u2580\u2580\u2580\u2580\u2580\n\n0:00 Climate Collapse\n4:20 Our Governments Failed\n7:40 The 1.5\u00b0C Limit Explained\n10:43 2026 Update\n13:00 Rising Global Temperature\n18:45 Crossing the Planetary Boundaries\n22:33 Ocean Crisis\n25:21 The \u2018Overshoot\u2019 Plan\n30:04 Could We Recover?\n\n\u2580\u2580\u2580\u2580\u2580\u2580\n\nSubscribe to the channel! \nhttps://youtube.com/@astrumearth \n\nA huge thanks to our Patreons who help make these videos possible. Sign-up here to support the channel: https://bit.ly/4aiJZNF \n\n\u2580\u2580\u2580\u2580\u2580\u2580\n\nCheck out the other Astrum channels for videos about space and astronomy:\nAstrum: https://www.youtube.com/@astrumspace \nAstrum Extra: https://www.youtube.com/@astrumextra \n\nAstrum Podcast on Spotify: https://open.spotify.com/show/6jPRrbq3o3dpvBb173ZTKi?si=a90d3efe3b704c83 \n\nAstrum Infographic Artwork: https://electrify.art/collections/astrum \nAstrum Displate Posters: https://astrumspace.info/Displates \nAstrum Merch: https://astrum-shop.fourthwall.com/\n\nJoin us on the Astrum discord: https://discord.gg/TKw8Hpvtv8 \n\n\u2580\u2580\u2580\u2580\u2580\u2580\n\nReferences:\n\u201cIt\u2019s Too Late: David Suzuki Says the Fight Against Climate Change Is Lost\u201d, via ipolitics.ca https://astrumspace.info/suzukiclimate \n\u201cHistory of the IPCC\u201d, via ipcc.ch https://astrumspace.info/ipcchistory \n\u201cThe Paris Agreement\u201d, via unfccc.int https://astrumspace.info/parisagreement \n\u201cIPCC Sixth Assessment Report\u201d, via ipcc.ch https://astrumspace.info/ipccar6 \n\u201cCarbon Dioxide Indicators\u201d, via nasa.gov https://astrumspace.info/co2indicators \n\u201cHurricane Melissa Reaches Category 5 Due to Climate Change\u201d, via climatecentral.org https://astrumspace.info/melissacat5 \n\u201cExtreme Heat Waves Under 1.5\u00b0C and 2\u00b0C Global Warming\u201d, via iopscience.iop.org https://astrumspace.info/extremeheat \n\u201cWhat Does the 1.5\u00b0C Threshold Mean?\u201d, via climate.gov https://astrumspace.info/threshold15 \n\u201cSeven of Nine Planetary Boundaries Now Breached\u201d, via pik-potsdam.de https://astrumspace.info/boundaries \n\u201cThe Ratchet Mechanism for Climate Overshoot\u201d, via carbonbrief.org https://astrumspace.info/ratchetmechanism \n\n\u2580\u2580\u2580\u